  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">We beodað þæt wiðersacan ⁊ útlagan Godes ⁊ manna of earde gewítan, buton hig gebúgan ⁊ ðe geornor gebétan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">We enjoin that apostates and those who are cast out from the fellowship of God and of men shall depart from the land, unless they submit and make amends to the utmost of their ability.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And we beodað, þæt wiðersacan ⁊ utlagan Godes ⁊ manna of eardæ gewitan, butan hig gebugan ⁊ þe geornor gebetan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
